{
    "word": "paktong",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                "word": "paktong",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "805dcc0b-b793-4c9b-8d3a-ac633e90a5d0",
                        "entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "paktongs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                        "entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An alloy of zinc, copper and nickel, closely resembling silver, of Chinese origin; any of a number of similar alloys developed in imitation of the Chinese product."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "943601b6-538f-4cb0-9199-1b673267ce3a",
                                "sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                                "text": "Chinese export metalwork consists almost entirely of three categories: silverware; pewterware; and paktong, an alloy of zinc, copper and nickel, closely resembling silver, which the Chinese also described as tutenague, and which was probably worked by white metalsmiths also making pewter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1cfc5e2-d059-4814-93e5-404cc12fe3f1",
                                "sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                                "text": "Many German-silver paktongs were soon flourishing under a variety of trade names, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bf9a758-b161-4398-9545-fd323c0ace2d",
                                "sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                                "text": "From the surviving descriptions it seems likely that during the later eighteenth century most paktong items were sold (in England at least) misleadingly under the name tutenag."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "89c4271a-b8be-4edf-85a1-5c1e1ee8567d",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "source_sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                        "source_sense_description": "alloy",
                        "target_lang_word": "cuivre blanc des Chinois",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "212849ed-37fd-4920-9f2b-4a4d12f7374c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "source_sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                        "source_sense_description": "alloy",
                        "target_lang_word": "toutenague",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "toutenague",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbee4ed0-4abb-3bd8-b9cb-6ce2e8c2b96e",
                                        "entry_id": "4bd4fb61-4105-33d4-a6ba-96b80181f871",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alliage métallique blanc à base de cuivre et de zinc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f741a78d-7583-49f6-a9ff-05b393b9b16c",
                                                "sense_id": "cbee4ed0-4abb-3bd8-b9cb-6ce2e8c2b96e",
                                                "text": "Au plomb d’Angleterre répond la toutenague ou pacfung de la Chine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbcbe32f-837b-4482-a3ea-8c2ca0f416d4",
                                                "sense_id": "cbee4ed0-4abb-3bd8-b9cb-6ce2e8c2b96e",
                                                "text": "La toutenague (tutiyanak, en persan), métal blanc, alliage de cuivre, de zinc et d’une faible quantité d’oxyde d’arsenic, servait à la production d’ustensiles de ménage en Orient, où on la désignait aussi sous le nom de « pierre de Chine » (hārsīnī), et en Espagne, où elle apparaît dans des textes plus tardifs sous la désignation de cazeni (argentum kazini)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce398978-ccbe-4839-be49-559cbd2bac35",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "source_sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                        "source_sense_description": "alloy",
                        "target_lang_word": "packfung",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "packfung",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ba5e0e3-da5d-324b-9655-12a187c338cc",
                                        "entry_id": "c1c15274-9bf2-358d-bf1c-10538ad6c3bb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante de pacfung."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efa29b17-0dd7-449c-ac08-9b3b4707dab9",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba5e0e3-da5d-324b-9655-12a187c338cc",
                                                "text": "Les plus communs des cadenas sont en baitong (ou packfung), un alliage de cuivre, de nickel et de zinc appelé aussi maillechort imitant lʼargent par la couleur et le poids."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45ec24cd-33f2-400b-a75f-726db0bdc827",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "source_sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                        "source_sense_description": "alloy",
                        "target_lang_word": "pacfung",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pacfung",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9608c56-bae5-31d1-84e8-0fce0a52b787",
                                        "entry_id": "c7ccb547-55fb-345a-9d92-b65330850443",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alliage de cuivre, nickel et zinc, ayant l’aspect de l’argent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6f0fc16-8aaa-46b0-874a-52280d5705a4",
                                                "sense_id": "a9608c56-bae5-31d1-84e8-0fce0a52b787",
                                                "text": "Il existe plusieurs alliages connus sous le nom de pacfung. Le pacfung parisien est composé de 67 parties de cuivre, 19,4 de nickel et 13,6 de zinc ; ou encore, de 66 de cuivre, 17 de nickel, 13 de zinc, 0,6 d'étain et 3,4 de fer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d25d91ff-fb69-4e71-b68c-6f3b78e818ee",
                                                "sense_id": "a9608c56-bae5-31d1-84e8-0fce0a52b787",
                                                "text": "Au plomb d’Angleterre répond la toutenague ou pacfung de la Chine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68283231-f2f6-4a0a-ae37-74e8fb606b7c",
                                                "sense_id": "a9608c56-bae5-31d1-84e8-0fce0a52b787",
                                                "text": "C'était une brasserie animée, refaite à neuf il y a longtemps, avec de grands miroirs muraux et un comptoir en pacfung, brillant et lustré, que surmontaient des étagères où étaient alignées toutes sortes de bouteilles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8b1041bd-547e-47a5-8ee7-90ff4f2d54c0",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a5aa27e-2524-39ae-b859-689c913dbbda",
                        "source_sense_id": "61fbeb25-b903-38c6-b512-df67740fd975",
                        "source_sense_description": "alloy",
                        "target_lang_word": "packfong",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "packfong",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "150199f2-8ccf-3562-8136-840ff9429ac7",
                                        "entry_id": "e4fb5901-f624-3bce-a650-078689af8dfa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante de pacfung."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d57c396f-1a0c-41cc-90ae-79946521f490",
                                                "sense_id": "150199f2-8ccf-3562-8136-840ff9429ac7",
                                                "text": "Le packfong et les ouvrages en packfong, en tant que leur qualité corresponde aux échantillons fixés d’un commun accord, seront dédouanés selon leur espèce dʼaprès les droits les plus bas des n°s 606-61 1 avec une réduction de 25 %."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
